Third-party components:

- bin/lyrichook64.dll statically links MinHook (https://github.com/TsudaKageyu/minhook),
  Copyright (c) 2009-2017 Tsuda Kageyu, MIT License. The DLL itself is built from
  bin-src/lyricstream.c and the hook sources in this repository's history; the
  injector (bin/inject.exe) and helper (bin/lyricstream.exe) are built from the
  C sources shipped here.
- vendor/schemastery is a bundled copy of schemastery 3.18.0 (MIT),
  and vendor/schemastery/node_modules/cosmokit is a bundled copy of cosmokit (MIT).
  They exist only as a runtime fallback for link-installed profiles; the declared
  dependency in package.json is the primary source.
